                                "sense_id": "bff1c346-4817-319f-a2e3-32cce444c9fc",
                                "text": "[…] This sodaine chaunge from feasting vnto fray\nMight well be likened to the Sea: whych standing at a stay\nThe woodnesse of the windes makes rough by raising of the waue."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "86a7d7db-3ab0-47e6-bf74-8780972bd458",
                                "sense_id": "bff1c346-4817-319f-a2e3-32cce444c9fc",
                                "text": "[…] with fell woodnes he effierced was,\nAnd wilfully him throwing on the gras\nDid beat and bounse his head and brest ful sore […]."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
